[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20100.548, "timestamp": "05:35:00", "text": "盒子，或者不管这东西是什么，就是盒子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20103.99, "timestamp": "05:35:03", "text": "线就在这两边之间，那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20106.23, "timestamp": "05:35:06", "text": "中间点，所以如果你正在使用手机"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20107.91, "timestamp": "05:35:07", "text": "即使屏幕较小，你仍然可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20111.03, "timestamp": "05:35:11", "text": "点击发送消息，我做到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20113.35, "timestamp": "05:35:13", "text": "我还做了拖拽功能，如果你有的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20115.35, "timestamp": "05:35:15", "text": "你想发送的长消息"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20117.47, "timestamp": "05:35:17", "text": "到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20118.99, "timestamp": "05:35:18", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20122.628, "timestamp": "05:35:22", "text": "嗯，我打算改一下这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20124.11, "timestamp": "05:35:24", "text": "向上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20128.59, "timestamp": "05:35:28", "text": "今天晚些时候我想发短信。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20131.788, "timestamp": "05:35:31", "text": "这些动画"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20132.89, "timestamp": "05:35:32", "text": "伙计们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20134.83, "timestamp": "05:35:34", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20137.788, "timestamp": "05:35:37", "text": "嗯，就像你参观的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20140.868, "timestamp": "05:35:40", "text": "网站，我希望当您访问时显示此内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20142.99, "timestamp": "05:35:42", "text": "滚动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20145.91, "timestamp": "05:35:45", "text": "向下。那么，我该怎么做呢？我们来算算"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20147.708, "timestamp": "05:35:47", "text": "把它拿出来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20150.548, "timestamp": "05:35:50", "text": "我们自己。所以，我们有一个 webhook 表单，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20151.628, "timestamp": "05:35:51", "text": "即"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20154.15, "timestamp": "05:35:54", "text": "那。这是什么段落？那是"}, 